# Architecture

- Meta-Intelligence Plane supervises capabilities; see `docs/META_INTELLIGENCE_PLANE.md`.
- Cross-plane writes only via APIs/events — no silent DB coupling.
- EventBus behind interface (`packages/observability` EventBus).
- Python for science; TypeScript for control plane.
